    <h1 class='text-7xl'>Amiel Christian Mala-ay</h1>
    <h2 class='text-5xl font-[Junicode]'>
      <span class='text-[var(--blue-1)]'>/ˈeɪ.miəl/</span>, alt. <span
        class='text-[var(--blue-1)]'>/a.mjɛl/</span
      >
    </h2>
    <div>
      My name is Amiel Christian Mala-ay, a software engineer based in Manila,
      specializing in full-stack web development and machine learning,
      particularly computer vision.
    </div>
    <div>
      From an early age, I have had a passion for technology and software, and I
      have always enjoyed building things, solving problems, and most
      importantly, learning new things. This led me to pursue a degree in
      Computer Science at the University of Santo Tomas, where I developed a
      solid foundation in full-stack web development and machine learning. I
      have also had the opportunity to work on a variety of projects that have
      allowed me to apply my knowledge and create impactful solutions to
      real-world projects.
    </div>
    <div>
      This website serves as a portfolio of my work, showcasing my skills and
      projects. I hope you enjoy exploring it as much as I enjoyed creating it!
      Please feel free to <a
        href='/contact'
        class='text-[var(--blue-2)] dark:text-[var(--blue-2-dark)] underline'
        >reach out</a
      > if you have any questions or would like to collaborate with me.
    </div>
